<title>UK: Credit Local ups 2002 bond to 500 bln lire.</title>
<headline>Credit Local ups 2002 bond to 500 bln lire.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Paribas.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CREDIT LOCAL DE FRANCE</p>
<p> AMT   *500 BLN ITL   COUPON     6.75	MATURITY    10.JAN.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE *101.93    PAY DATE    10.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  =	   LISTING    =	   PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> NOTES    *ORIGINAL 300 BLN LIRE BOND LAUNCHED 27.NOV</p>
</text>
